  "body": "For more than eight years this was where our family grew up — beach days that ran into dusk, sandy footprints through the door, teenagers claiming their own wing. We've since moved on some time ago, and it's time for a new family to make their own memories here.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare one. A genuine beachfront holding on one of Orewa's most tightly held stretches of coast — 3km of golden sand quite literally at your doorstep, yet only 30 minutes from the Auckland CBD. Sites like this, this close to the water, almost never come up.\r\nThe home is comfortable and fully liveable as-is — a spacious 6-bedroom layout with real flexibility:\r\n\r\nLive in the main 4-bedroom home and rent out the self-contained 2-bedroom wing (our former \"teenagers' wing\") as a home-and-income, helping offset the mortgage; or\r\nTake the whole house as one large family home; or\r\nLand-bank and develop — huge potential to design and build your dream beachfront home on a very rare large site.\r\n\r\nIt's currently tenanted by excellent tenants who would love to stay on, so it can settle as a ready-made investment from day one, or be delivered with vacant possession by arrangement.\r\n\r\nPotential vendor finance available to suitable purchasers. Also, potentially open to trades if you have a home you need sold that appeals to us. \r\n\r\nPrice by negotiation\r\nEnquiries to Greg on 021415744\r\n\r\nA very rare beachfront opportunity — to live in, to invest, or to build. \r\n\r\nWe also own the neighboring section at 371C Hibiscus Coast Highway which can be purchased separately or together which has a new consent to build a luxury 4 bed, 2 living, double garage home, 2 level home with lift and a with a private swimming pool. See attached pics for the design of what we are going to build there. Unless you want to buy both and change the plans?",
